Maintainer: AlexFirst404 <alextorx2020@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AlexFirst404/CONTROLGUI
Description: CONTROLGUI - local Minecraft server control panel
 Web panel (Node.js, no npm dependencies) to manage real Minecraft servers:
 Vanilla, Paper, Purpur, Folia, Mohist and Forge. Real-time console, resource
 monitoring, file manager with editor, players with inventory, backups, and
 plugin/mod install from Modrinth. Picks a matching Java per version.
 .
 Launching opens the panel in an app window (Chromium app mode) or the default
 browser at http://localhost:8400. Server data is stored under the user's home
 (~/.local/share/controlgui). Needs a Java runtime to run Minecraft servers and
 libarchive-tools (bsdtar) to read .jar metadata.
